{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/20d24801277d5886eafde41fa41a2a33.poster.avif?t=1772556743\" width=610 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/20d24801277d5886eafde41fa41a2a33.webm?t=1772556743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This Is Fine. Everything Is Fine.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except it isn\u2019t. Welcome to Question Hound\u2019s collapsing inner world. Step into a strange park built from pure anxiety, where your regrets, deadlines, and awkward memories have grown claws. There\u2019s only one way out, and it involves a lot of coffee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/4597b0f0ac8f3a279d4873c57e7e5ef3.poster.avif?t=1772556743\" width=612 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/4597b0f0ac8f3a279d4873c57e7e5ef3.webm?t=1772556743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/4597b0f0ac8f3a279d4873c57e7e5ef3.mp4?t=1772556743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Humiliation. Fear. Failure. Loss. Regret.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve all felt them. But have you ever been trapped inside their prison, teeming with minions? Taunted by ghostly memories of your high school blunder years, hunted by dizzying work deadlines, or haunted by all the things you probably should never have done? Sounds fun, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to face those demons head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/301319f1bc2c6b403ca769161f704e68.poster.avif?t=1772556743\" width=612 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/301319f1bc2c6b403ca769161f704e68.webm?t=1772556743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Lies Ahead?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you platform your way through each world, you\u2019ll encounter enemies that each represent a very specific everyday anxiety. From biting toilet monsters to flying textbooks, every threat is a familiar feeling in a funny disguise. Explore five emotional worlds, take down the unique boss in each area, and unlock new abilities that let you dive deeper into the chaos, revisiting earlier places and pushing into new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/eae35565fdd8a91dcd5dc4cb43e0c2a7.poster.avif?t=1772556743\" width=612 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/eae35565fdd8a91dcd5dc4cb43e0c2a7.webm?t=1772556743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to stop at every burning Rest Point to save, sip coffee, and pretend everything is fine for a brief moment. Collect Coffee Beans as you explore; your currency used to purchase perks and refill your healing coffee cup. Keep your eyes peeled everywhere you go if your heart is set on finding every quirky collectible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/35d8ad569f9232ef90158f5698175c7a.poster.avif?t=1772556743\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/35d8ad569f9232ef90158f5698175c7a.webm?t=1772556743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Brought to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Is Fine: Maximum Cope transforms KC Green\u2019s famous comic into a lovingly animated labyrinth of absurd anxiety. Angst and helplessness have never looked so good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world is a dreamy, surreal experience. Every enemy oozes with personality, and every boss looms larger than life. It\u2019s weird, it\u2019s fun, and just the right amount of unhinged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/ac515847bbc18df5e77486ff9bd7477d.poster.avif?t=1772556743\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/ac515847bbc18df5e77486ff9bd7477d.webm?t=1772556743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is fine. Everything is fine. Whether you\u2019re a genre fan or just here for the dog, this is an adventure built to surprise \u2014 and occasionally roast you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/f1a6806e936a1b149b86c8b77443eb94.poster.avif?t=1772556743\" width=612 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/f1a6806e936a1b149b86c8b77443eb94.webm?t=1772556743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 surreal worlds of Humiliation, Fear, Failure, Loss, and Regret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 bosses to conquer, 6 abilities to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 quirky collectibles to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 perks to unlock and equip</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3229980?t=1772556743","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/773e0f6459b675bf20e7eb8c7e0ba51656a7cc2c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772556743","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/87922a6e799502610d9caa7788fff28d53c1ac5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772556743","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/87922a6e799502610d9caa7788fff28d53c1ac5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772556743","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3994730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.aka